{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》將於周日（11月1日）播出第9集，7位女神與12位求愛勇者將移師主題公園，透過水上遊戲進一步展現真性情。</p><p>製作組今天（28日）公開7位女神何沛珈（Roxanne）、陳若思（Amber）、郭珮文（Juliana）、梁超怡（Chiuyi）、陳星妤（Yvette）、阮嘉敏（Mandy）及俞可程（Kanis）的泳裝照片，除個人照外，亦有多張合照及拍攝花絮。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:22:29.145812+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:41:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:15.652520+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:18:47.298984+00:00","content_hash":"601d76d31eccdc83ed3e7868fbad1930c62639ec8cdd0c281d9f1e7a87accc03","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}